#ASSERT `Which payments can I apply for` `1 Aug 2026` `assault` FALSE `a death` `injured` FALSE `murdered` `a brother, sister, stepbrother, stepsister, half-brother or half-sister` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `may apply for` `no recognition`
#ASSERT `What is the most I can receive for one application` `1 Aug 2026` `assault` FALSE `a death` `injured` FALSE `murdered` `a brother, sister, stepbrother, stepsister, half-brother or half-sister` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the most that can be paid, in dollars` 13590
#ASSERT `What recognition payment can I get` `1 Aug 2026` `assault` FALSE `a death` `injured` FALSE `murdered` `a brother, sister, stepbrother, stepsister, half-brother or half-sister` FALSE FALSE FALSE `none of the offences in table 8` FALSE EQUALS `none: not eligible to apply for this payment (ss 18 to 23)`

