#ASSERT `Which payments can I apply for` `1 Aug 2026` `assault` FALSE `a death` `injured` FALSE `murdered` `a brother, sister, stepbrother, stepsister, half-brother or half-sister` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `may not apply: not a victim under the Act (ss 7, 11 to 18)`
