#ASSERT `Which payments can I apply for` `1 Aug 2026` `assault` FALSE `own injury` `injured` FALSE `murdered` `no relation` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `may apply for` `no recognition`
#ASSERT `What is the most I can receive for one application` `1 Aug 2026` `assault` FALSE `own injury` `injured` FALSE `murdered` `no relation` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `the most that can be paid, in dollars` 13590
