#ASSERT `What is the most I can be paid for this economic loss` `1 Aug 2026` `assault` FALSE `own injury` `injured` FALSE `murdered` `no relation` FALSE TRUE FALSE `expenses, other than legal costs, of making the application` 150 FALSE EQUALS `the most that can be paid, in dollars` 150
