#ASSERT `Can I get a funeral expense payment, and how much` `1 Aug 2026` `assault` FALSE `murdered` TRUE 6500 `1 Aug 2026` `15 Sep 2026` FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 EQUALS `a funeral expense payment of at most, in dollars` 6500
