#ASSERT `Can I get a funeral expense payment, and how much` `1 Aug 2026` `assault` FALSE `murdered` TRUE 11400 `1 Aug 2026` `15 Sep 2026` FALSE FALSE FALSE 3000 EQUALS `a funeral expense payment of at most, in dollars` 5000
-- s 54: last day 1 August 2029; on 2 August 2029 it is too late, and nothing allows an extension.
