#ASSERT `Can I get a funeral expense payment, and how much` `1 Aug 2026` `assault` FALSE `murdered` TRUE 11400 `1 Aug 2026` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 8 2029) FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 EQUALS `a funeral expense payment of at most, in dollars` 8000
#ASSERT `Can I get a funeral expense payment, and how much` `1 Aug 2026` `assault` FALSE `murdered` TRUE 11400 `1 Aug 2026` (DATE_FROM_DMY 2 8 2029) FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 EQUALS `no funeral expense payment: the application is more than 3 years after the death, and the Act gives no power to extend that time (s 54)`
