-- CASE 10. Deadlines after a decision.
-- =====================================================================================================================

-- s 92 (2): the amount decided (s 46, sch 2 pt 2.1 item 2); notice given 1 April 2027: by 29 April 2027.
#ASSERT `By when must I ask for a decision to be reconsidered` `the amount of financial assistance (s 46)` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 2027) EQUALS `apply to the commissioner for reconsideration, in writing with the grounds, by` (DATE_FROM_DMY 29 4 2027)
#ASSERT `By when must I ask for a decision to be reconsidered` `not to extend the time for making an application (s 32)` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 2027) EQUALS `apply to the commissioner for reconsideration, in writing with the grounds, by` (DATE_FROM_DMY 29 4 2027)
-- A refusal under s 45 is only ACAT-reviewable (sch 2 pt 2.2 item 3, not pt 2.1): its time limit is not deposited.
#ASSERT `By when must I ask for a decision to be reconsidered` `that financial assistance is not to be given (s 45)` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 2027) EQUALS `review not covered` `ACAT not covered`
#ASSERT `By when must I ask for a decision to be reconsidered` `that applications involve related acts of violence (s 44)` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 2027) EQUALS `review not covered` `ACAT not covered`
-- A repayment direction: to the ACAT on or before the repayment date (s 67 (3) (b)).
#ASSERT `By when must I ask for a decision to be reconsidered` `a requirement to repay financial assistance (s 67)` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 2027) EQUALS `apply to the ACAT for review on or before the repayment date in the repayment direction notice (s 67 (3) (b))`
-- s 45 (2) (b): notice received 10 January 2027; 14 days later, 24 January 2027.
#ASSERT `By when must I answer a notice of a disqualifying circumstance` (DATE_FROM_DMY 10 1 2027) EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 24 1 2027

